   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at building the capacity of the Moldovan Migration Bureau. NMB and IOM have identified priorities in the area of Migration management. The project will enhance the Government&apos;s capacity to manage the extensive migration flows, based on improved data collection and analysis. The project will also enhance Moldova&apos;s capacity to work with asylum and immigration related issues.</narrative>
